    {
      "test_id": "S03-SAS-09-2",
      "job_id": "S03",
      "trap_id": "SAS-09",
      "description": "Three policies, each with several transactions in different bands. For every policy, the first row in load order is not the row with the lowest txn_id or the earliest txn_date, and it falls in a different band from those rows. Policy rows are also interleaved in load order. NODUPKEY bands each policy on its first loaded row. dropDuplicates (arbitrary row), or a window ordered by txn_id or txn_date, picks another row and moves all of that policy's transactions to another band.",
